---
import FieldworkLayout from '../../layouts/FieldworkLayout.astro';
---

<FieldworkLayout
  title="Services | Fieldwork"
  description="Parks, streets, masterplanning and community engagement: the four services Fieldwork offers."
>
  <main id="main">
    <!-- Template: Services index. Page header / Service cards / Process steps / Logo grid / CTA -->

    <header class="page-header">
      <div class="page-header__inner container">
        <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <ol>
            <li><a href="/templates/home/">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="/templates/services/" aria-current="page">Services</a></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>
        <p class="page-header__label">Services</p>
        <h1 class="page-header__title text-page-title">From a single street to a new neighbourhood.</h1>
        <p class="page-header__lead text-lead">Four services, one approach: understand the place, involve the people, design for the long term.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section" data-spacing="none" aria-label="Services">
      <div class="container">
        <ul class="grid" data-columns="2" role="list">
          <li>
            <article class="card" data-variant="bordered">
              <figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><img src="https://placehold.co/1600x1200/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure>
              <p class="card__meta">01</p>
              <h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/service/">Parks and open space</a></h2>
              <p class="card__summary">Pocket parks to regional landscapes, designed with the communities who will look after them.</p>
              <span class="card__action" aria-hidden="true">Explore <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></span>
            </article>
          </li>
          <li>
            <article class="card" data-variant="bordered">
              <figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><img src="https://placehold.co/1600x1200/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure>
              <p class="card__meta">02</p>
              <h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/service/">Streets and public realm</a></h2>
              <p class="card__summary">Street redesigns that make walking, cycling and staying the obvious choice.</p>
              <span class="card__action" aria-hidden="true">Explore <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></span>
            </article>
          </li>
          <li>
            <article class="card" data-variant="bordered">
              <figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><img src="https://placehold.co/1600x1200/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure>
              <p class="card__meta">03</p>
              <h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/service/">Masterplanning</a></h2>
              <p class="card__summary">Landscape-led frameworks for new neighbourhoods, starting from what is already there.</p>
              <span class="card__action" aria-hidden="true">Explore <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></span>
            </article>
          </li>
          <li>
            <article class="card" data-variant="bordered">
              <figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><img src="https://placehold.co/1600x1200/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure>
              <p class="card__meta">04</p>
              <h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/service/">Community engagement</a></h2>
              <p class="card__summary">Workshops, walks and pop-up studios that shape a brief before a line is drawn.</p>
              <span class="card__action" aria-hidden="true">Explore <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></span>
            </article>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="process-title">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-header">
          <p class="section-header__label">Process</p>
          <h2 class="section-header__title text-section-heading" id="process-title">How a project runs.</h2>
          <p class="section-header__intro">The same five stages apply whether the site is a courtyard or a county park.</p>
        </header>
        <ol class="grid" data-columns="4" role="list">
          <li class="feature"><span class="feature__index">01</span><h3 class="feature__title">Listen</h3><p class="feature__text">Site walks, interviews and workshops with the people who use the place.</p></li>
          <li class="feature"><span class="feature__index">02</span><h3 class="feature__title">Understand</h3><p class="feature__text">Surveys of trees, soils, water, movement and habitats.</p></li>
          <li class="feature"><span class="feature__index">03</span><h3 class="feature__title">Design</h3><p class="feature__text">Options tested with the community, then developed to construction.</p></li>
          <li class="feature"><span class="feature__index">04</span><h3 class="feature__title">Build and return</h3><p class="feature__text">Site supervision, then visits at one, three and five years.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="clients-title">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-header">
          <p class="section-header__label">Clients</p>
          <h2 class="section-header__title text-section-heading" id="clients-title">Councils, developers and trusts.</h2>
        </header>
        <ul class="logo-list" data-layout="grid">
          <li class="logo"><img src="https://placehold.co/110x40/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="Halden Council" width="110" height="40" loading="lazy"></li>
          <li class="logo"><img src="https://placehold.co/150x40/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="Oakmere Homes" width="150" height="40" loading="lazy"></li>
          <li class="logo"><img src="https://placehold.co/140x40/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="Northgate Trust" width="140" height="40" loading="lazy"></li>
          <li class="logo"><img src="https://placehold.co/120x40/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="Parallel Developments" width="120" height="40" loading="lazy"></li>
          <li class="logo"><img src="https://placehold.co/160x40/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="Linden and Co" width="160" height="40" loading="lazy"></li>
          <li class="logo"><img src="https://placehold.co/110x40/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="Aster Housing" width="110" height="40" loading="lazy"></li>
          <li class="logo"><img src="https://placehold.co/110x40/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="Halden Council" width="110" height="40" loading="lazy"></li>
          <li class="logo"><img src="https://placehold.co/140x40/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="Northgate Trust" width="140" height="40" loading="lazy"></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" data-surface="brand" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta" data-layout="centered">
          <div class="cta__content">
            <h2 class="text-page-title" id="cta-title">Not sure which service fits?</h2>
            <p class="cta__text">Describe the site and what you hope for. We will suggest a starting point.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cta__actions">
            <div class="button-group" data-stack="mobile">
              <a class="button" href="/templates/contact/">Talk to us <svg class="icon" data-icon="arrow-right" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</FieldworkLayout>
